## 数据模型设计

### 任务数据模型

```typescript
interface Todo {
  id: string;              // UUID
  title: string;           // 任务标题
  description?: string;    // 任务描述 (可选)
  completed: boolean;      // 完成状态
  createdAt: Date;        // 创建时间
  updatedAt: Date;        // 更新时间
  priority?: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high'; // 优先级 (可选)
}

interface TodoList {
  todos: Todo[];
  lastModified: Date;
}
```

### 设置数据模型

```typescript
interface AppSettings {
  // 窗口设置
  window: {
    position: { x: number; y: number };
    size: { width: number; height: number };
    alwaysOnTop: boolean;
    pinned: boolean;
  };

  // 外观设置
  appearance: {
    theme: 'light' | 'dark' | 'system';
    background: BackgroundSettings;
    fontSize: 'small' | 'medium' | 'large';
  };

  // 背景设置
  background: {
    type: 'glass' | 'transparent' | 'solid' | 'semi';
    opacity: number;        // 0-100
    color?: string;         // 纯色背景颜色
    glassIntensity?: number; // 毛玻璃强度 0-100
  };

  // 应用设置
  app: {
    autoStart: boolean;
    minimizeToTray: boolean;
    showInDock: boolean;
  };
}
```

## API 设计

### Tauri Commands (后端 API)

#### 任务管理 Commands

```rust
// 获取所有任务
#[tauri::command]
async fn get_todos() -> Result<Vec<Todo>, String>

// 添加任务
#[tauri::command]
async fn add_todo(title: String, description: Option<String>) -> Result<Todo, String>

// 更新任务
#[tauri::command]
async fn update_todo(id: String, updates: TodoUpdate) -> Result<Todo, String>

// 删除任务
#[tauri::command]
async fn delete_todo(id: String) -> Result<(), String>

// 切换任务完成状态
#[tauri::command]
async fn toggle_todo(id: String) -> Result<Todo, String>
```

#### 设置管理 Commands

```rust
// 获取设置
#[tauri::command]
async fn get_settings() -> Result<AppSettings, String>

// 更新设置
#[tauri::command]
async fn update_settings(settings: AppSettings) -> Result<(), String>

// 重置设置
#[tauri::command]
async fn reset_settings() -> Result<AppSettings, String>
```

#### 窗口控制 Commands

```rust
// 设置窗口置顶
#[tauri::command]
async fn set_always_on_top(always_on_top: bool) -> Result<(), String>

// 设置窗口透明度
#[tauri::command]
async fn set_window_opacity(opacity: f64) -> Result<(), String>

// 调整窗口大小
#[tauri::command]
async fn resize_window(height: f64) -> Result<(), String>

// 设置窗口位置
#[tauri::command]
async fn set_window_position(x: f64, y: f64) -> Result<(), String>
```

### 前端 API 服务

#### TodoService

```typescript
class TodoService {
  async getTodos(): Promise<Todo[]>
  async addTodo(title: string, description?: string): Promise<Todo>
  async updateTodo(id: string, updates: Partial<Todo>): Promise<Todo>
  async deleteTodo(id: string): Promise<void>
  async toggleTodo(id: string): Promise<Todo>
}
```

#### SettingsService

```typescript
class SettingsService {
  async getSettings(): Promise<AppSettings>
  async updateSettings(settings: Partial<AppSettings>): Promise<void>
  async resetSettings(): Promise<AppSettings>
}
```

#### WindowService

```typescript
class WindowService {
  async setAlwaysOnTop(alwaysOnTop: boolean): Promise<void>
  async setOpacity(opacity: number): Promise<void>
