## 状态管理设计

### Todo 状态管理 (Zustand)

```typescript
interface TodoStore {
  // 状态
  todos: Todo[];
  loading: boolean;
  error: string | null;

  // 操作
  loadTodos: () => Promise<void>;
  addTodo: (title: string, description?: string) => Promise<void>;
  updateTodo: (id: string, updates: Partial<Todo>) => Promise<void>;
  deleteTodo: (id: string) => Promise<void>;
  toggleTodo: (id: string) => Promise<void>;
  clearError: () => void;
}
```

### 设置状态管理

```typescript
interface SettingsStore {
  // 状态
  settings: AppSettings;
  loading: boolean;

  // 操作
  loadSettings: () => Promise<void>;
  updateSettings: (updates: Partial<AppSettings>) => Promise<void>;
  resetSettings: () => Promise<void>;

  // 便捷方法
  setTheme: (theme: Theme) => Promise<void>;
  setBackground: (background: BackgroundSettings) => Promise<void>;
  setWindowBehavior: (behavior: WindowBehavior) => Promise<void>;
}
```

## 文件存储设计

### 数据文件结构

```
~/.local/share/ImageTodo/  (Linux)
~/Library/Application Support/ImageTodo/  (macOS)
%APPDATA%/ImageTodo/  (Windows)
├── todos.json           # 任务数据
├── settings.json        # 应用设置
├── backups/            # 自动备份
│   ├── todos_backup_1.json
│   └── settings_backup_1.json
└── logs/               # 日志文件 (可选)
    └── app.log
```

### 数据持久化策略

1. **实时保存**: 任务和设置变更立即保存到文件
2. **原子写入**: 使用临时文件 + 重命名确保数据完整性
3. **自动备份**: 每次保存前创建备份文件
4. **错误恢复**: 文件损坏时自动从备份恢复

## 窗口管理设计

### 窗口配置

```json
{
  "windows": [
    {
      "label": "main",
      "title": "ImageTodo",
      "width": 320,
      "height": 400,
      "minWidth": 280,
      "minHeight": 200,
      "maxHeight": 800,
      "resizable": false,
      "decorations": false,
      "transparent": true,
      "alwaysOnTop": false,
      "skipTaskbar": false,
      "center": true
    }
  ]
